    {
      "id": "claim_0c873d3b37cc4f9496a7686d3af12920",
      "statement": "config/TypeSafeConfig defines the TypeSafeClient bean itself so the spring-ai-starter-typesafe auto-configuration's @ConditionalOnMissingBean backs off, preventing the starter's own bean (which asserts a non-blank api-key) from crashing startup on a blank MYFEEDER_TYPESAFE_API_KEY; a blank key instead logs the fixed line 'TypeSafe Jev not configured; interest scoring disabled'.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L23-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b46d6e675f7853ae8957f068081841f0385834ae5edb9d4f93bf0fea780734ca:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_8b024e0c75c34b81be4ceb8c4e350a25",
      "statement": "TypeSafeConfig passes the API key to the TypeSafeClient builder only via the Supplier overload (.apiKey(() -> ...)) because the String overload asserts non-blank text at build time, and sets baseUrl, defaultModel, timeout and retryPolicy explicitly so the SDK never falls back to its own TYPESAFE_* environment variables.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L51-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:07ffbdb99f36c9ac1e89d4d87caa9ceb4372ca834e521e47d60990cd8c10b712:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ab159ed2bca342bd8bfd2078fdd57b59",
      "statement": "TypeSafeConfig builds a Jev-only Reactor Netty request factory (connect timeout 5s, read timeout = spring.ai.typesafe.timeout, 30s in main application.yaml) and sets it on a clone() of the auto-configured RestClient.Builder, preserving the shared User-Agent customizer without altering the transport used by any other RestClient consumer (feed fetches, Raindrop).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L43-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dcf062acd4fb9203fc2bbb2f25bf255f40a261433d731330598c73ece796f6cd:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/resources/application.yaml#L13-L18",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2f5e796a105180aedce174206a65454156f6d06fb32d079ed42a672740161527:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e3351cacb24b4c76b4a86775c253c353",
      "statement": "The app must never build a second TypeSafeClient bean or reuse this bean's transport/RestClient.Builder for feed fetching or other outbound calls; the Jev-only timeouts exist because a profile-plus-topics scoring call can take multiple seconds (~2.6s average, >5s cold for a profile plus 7 topics).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CLAUDE.md#L236-L236",
