    {
      "id": "claim_f87abc57c9d847b4881ccda5d8c104e1",
      "statement": "The jev Resilience4j retry instance allows 3 attempts, waits 1s then 2s by default via TypeSafeConfig.jevRetryInterval, honors a 429's server-supplied retry-after-ms instead of the exponential backoff when present, clamped to [0, 10000] ms (MAX_RETRY_AFTER_MS), and only retries TypeSafeRateLimitException, TypeSafeInternalServerException and TypeSafeApiConnectionException; JevNotConfiguredException is ignored by the retry.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/org/bartram/myfeeder/config/TypeSafeConfig.java#L40-L84",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e74efd6032d557125d6e87658c0fe08212e814730c08a3c72fe92bbfe8fd0ffa:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/resources/application.yaml#L102-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fe7d38b7ab411f5f9b7d551259544441244585c7c749fe0c97d1ec3c453ca624:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4c54bf6914604e069b434764e6829674",
      "statement": "The jev Resilience4j circuit breaker uses a COUNT_BASED sliding window of 20 calls, a minimum of 10 calls before evaluation, a 50% failure-rate threshold, a 50% slow-call-rate threshold at a 15s slow-call duration, stays OPEN for 60s, and automatically transitions OPEN to HALF_OPEN without needing a call.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/resources/application.yaml#L74-L84",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:7a73ecba7fe6c91abcda6fa567f926507d965402bf374ee1c51256919a1003f3:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7eb4fce854e84c898f55a27f7f4a6254",
      "statement": "circuit-breaker-aspect-order (1) is lower than retry-aspect-order (2), making the jev breaker the outer aspect that records one outcome per logical call (including all retry attempts), and 401/403 (TypeSafeAuthenticationException/TypeSafePermissionDeniedException) are deliberately left out of the breaker's ignore-exceptions so a bad or revoked API key is recorded as a failure and can open the breaker.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://CLAUDE.md#L159-L159",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5d0f0bb55f483bcbec973740f2ac49b5e091a9dd6ba07fd14118983c5546e27a:"
